B: George Kauntze "Kauntze's Collection of the most favorite Dances, Reels, Waltzes, &c."
F: http://imslp.org/wiki/Kauntze%27s_Collection_of_Dances,_Reels,_Waltzes_etc._%28Various%29
N: This was published in London, some time in the late 1700s, but the actual year seems to be unknown.
N: The online photocopies are from a copy in the Biblioteca Nacional de Espa\~na.
N: Although the book isn't dated, there are several online dates of 1795.
